{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fears to Fathom [Together] is an episodic psychological co-op horror game where each episode unveils a short story narrated by the ones who survived.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fears to Fathom : Scratch Creek</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this episode of Fears to Fathom, you play as Tessa Langley or Marcus Reed \u2014 a young couple from Oregon preparing to move to another state. Due to unforeseen circumstances, their journey took an unexpected turn, leading them to the town of Scratch Creek. Little did they know what was transpiring in the\u00a0decrepit small town. The couple survived as they <i><strong>collectively</strong></i><strong> made the right choices.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a 2-player narrative co-op walking simulator with driving and exploration mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS film aesthetic. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity Voice Chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive texts from NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text the other survivor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player voice activity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duo Matchmaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-Player Co-Op.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4121170?t=1772481849","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121170/b03bbd0e39d39c3af699d6dc480cb73c8d03d2af/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772481849","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121170/e6ddbec61e35616033db5de0f969fc6c1d1c8b20/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=177248184